  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KASFA Increased Rice Production and Marketing Capacity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: agriculture (rice).Description: KASFA wants to improve its capacity to manage the association and improve marketing. Currently most of their produce is sold to a larger organization; the farmers believe that if they can brand their own rice, they could get more profits thereby improving their livelihoods.</narrative>
  </description>
